{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Item Recovery and Worldforged refund mail taken before a trial do not block starting it",
  "contract": [
    "Taking mail before a trial marks the character OUTSIDE_MAIL, which blocks a non-prestige trial, unless the",
    "take is exempt. The challenge exempts Item Recovery and Worldforged refund mail (sender-less GM-stationery",
    "mail with ITEM_RECOVERY_MAIL_SUBJECT or WORLDFORGED_REFUND_MAIL_SUBJECT), so recovering one's own item must",
    "not stop a later trial. Expected: a fresh level-1 character that takes a Silverleaf from Item Recovery mail",
    "and a Mageroyal from Worldforged refund mail still starts Hardcore (challenge 54, a non-prestige trial) with",
    "start code 0. A second fresh character that takes an Earthroot from the same mail with another subject",
    "(boss loot, challenge rewards) is refused with CHALLENGE_START_CONDITIONS_NOT_MET (8) and told it has",
    "taken items or money from the mailbox, so only the subject separates the two outcomes."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
  "location": {
